.el .ds Aq '
.TH quarters-rename 1  "quarters-rename " 
.SH NAME
quarters\-rename \- Change an inactive stable\-identity space display name
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquarters\-rename\fR [\fB\-\-preview\fR] [\fB\-\-confirm\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPREVIOUS\fR> <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Change an inactive stable\-identity space display name
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-preview\fR
Validate identities, activity and collisions without changing state
.TP
\fB\-\-confirm\fR \fI<PREVIOUS>\fR
Exactly repeat PREVIOUS to execute the recoverable rename
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPREVIOUS\fR>
Current space name
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
New space name
